WEBVTT

01:40.009 --> 01:42.920
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.220 --> 01:45.710
[Episode 29]

01:48.530 --> 01:49.930
Return the dragon scale!

01:54.680 --> 01:56.680
That's because Ying Lei trusts you.

01:57.380 --> 01:59.240
He didn't expect you to lie to him.

02:00.480 --> 02:01.340
Zhuo,

02:01.790 --> 02:03.120
what happened?

02:03.670 --> 02:05.500
He gave Ying Lei an empty box.

02:09.910 --> 02:10.789
But

02:11.280 --> 02:13.470
Li Lun wants to stop us from fixing the sword so badly.

02:13.470 --> 02:16.000
He will definitely come for the dragon scale.

02:20.960 --> 02:21.829
Seal.

02:21.829 --> 02:24.500
You and Li Lun know each other well.

02:24.620 --> 02:26.150
How can such a simple spell

02:26.610 --> 02:28.370
guard against Li Lun?

02:29.030 --> 02:30.690
You did it to guard against us.

02:32.070 --> 02:33.230
You were afraid we'd find out

02:33.230 --> 02:35.230
there was no dragon scale in the box.

02:36.320 --> 02:37.510
I thought

02:37.710 --> 02:38.990
you took the dragon scale

02:38.990 --> 02:41.510
because you were worried about Ying Lei guarding it.

02:41.510 --> 02:43.200
You were afraid he'd attract trouble,

02:43.200 --> 02:44.380
putting him

02:44.440 --> 02:45.550
in danger,

02:46.260 --> 02:47.920
so I didn't mention it.

02:48.740 --> 02:50.350
But your reaction just now

02:50.890 --> 02:52.510
was obviously to mislead us.

02:53.990 --> 02:55.430
Now, the completely ignorant Ying Lei

02:55.430 --> 02:56.990
got into danger after chasing Ao Yin

02:56.990 --> 02:58.590
for an empty box.

02:59.220 --> 03:01.150
Aren’t you going to tell the truth?

03:05.460 --> 03:06.480
Jiu.

03:08.640 --> 03:09.440
My lord.

03:27.450 --> 03:28.250
Stop!

03:31.020 --> 03:33.820
I wonder if the organs of a half-demon and half-god

03:34.370 --> 03:36.500
would be more useful than human liver.

03:37.760 --> 03:39.760
I did take the dragon scale.

03:41.860 --> 03:43.350
You sacrificed Ying Lei

03:44.470 --> 03:46.930
to attract the attention of Li Lun and Ao Yin.

03:48.670 --> 03:50.400
He wouldn't go to that extreme.

03:51.150 --> 03:53.350
You want the dragon scale for yourself?

03:54.700 --> 03:56.230
It's useless to you.

03:56.750 --> 03:58.150
What would you do with it?

03:58.590 --> 03:59.790
I have my own purpose.

04:00.500 --> 04:02.270
But I can't tell you now.

04:09.270 --> 04:11.130
Ying Lei is Ying Zhao's grandson.

04:11.590 --> 04:14.180
Li Lun and Ying Zhao were old friends of many years.

04:14.180 --> 04:15.740
He won't do anything to him.

04:18.390 --> 04:19.190
A—

04:19.950 --> 04:20.910
Again...

04:47.630 --> 04:48.790
Free me!

04:48.990 --> 04:50.000
Free me!

04:50.070 --> 04:50.870
Undo your immobilization spell!

04:50.870 --> 04:51.430
Shut up!

04:51.940 --> 04:53.740
If it weren't for Ying Zhao,

04:54.510 --> 04:56.370
he would have killed you long ago.

04:57.230 --> 04:58.030
Jiu!

04:58.750 --> 05:00.160
Give Jiu back to me!

05:00.630 --> 05:02.010
You didn't get the dragon scale.

05:02.010 --> 05:03.700
Wait to get stripped away!

05:04.190 --> 05:04.750
Jiu,

05:04.780 --> 05:06.690
I will save you!

05:07.030 --> 05:07.830
So noisy.

05:08.110 --> 05:08.670
I...

05:27.190 --> 05:28.190
I heard

05:28.990 --> 05:30.570
you stole the dragon scale.

05:31.910 --> 05:32.870
I also heard that

05:34.110 --> 05:36.110
Lord Bai Yan took the Baize Token.

05:37.670 --> 05:38.750
You found out?

05:39.950 --> 05:41.350
There’s deadly poison

05:42.830 --> 05:44.560
on the Baize Token instrument,

05:44.870 --> 05:45.710
right?

05:49.500 --> 05:51.040
You can hide it from Wen Xiao

05:51.940 --> 05:53.350
but not me.

05:56.150 --> 05:57.470
I searched Wen Xiao's body

05:57.470 --> 05:59.400
with the sea of the soul last night.

06:09.480 --> 06:10.850
Now,

06:12.770 --> 06:14.770
she has been poisoned.

06:17.310 --> 06:18.120
Yes.

06:18.770 --> 06:21.720
So these days that I was gone, I went to find Tao Tie

06:22.120 --> 06:23.890
to see if I can purify

06:23.920 --> 06:25.580
the poison on the Baize Token.

06:32.159 --> 06:33.400
Wen Xiao

06:33.420 --> 06:34.490
is poisoned?

06:42.300 --> 06:44.630
The poison was applied on the instrument.

06:44.950 --> 06:46.480
It's colorless, odorless,

06:46.630 --> 06:47.930
and hard to detect.

06:48.550 --> 06:51.790
Every time you used the Baize Order to play the instrument,

06:51.790 --> 06:54.409
the poison entered your body unconsciously.

06:54.870 --> 06:56.130
The poison

06:58.510 --> 07:00.710
should have entered the heart already.

07:04.030 --> 07:06.160
That's why you stole the dragon scale?

07:09.720 --> 07:12.740
Did Li Lun do this secretly

07:13.430 --> 07:15.090
when he stole the Divine Wood?

07:16.870 --> 07:18.530
Can the poison be detoxified?

07:20.710 --> 07:21.640
It's hard.

07:24.820 --> 07:25.940
Lord Bai Yan,

07:27.190 --> 07:28.880
why did you keep it from me?

07:29.480 --> 07:31.280
Why didn't you tell me the truth?

07:32.390 --> 07:35.120
She was afraid that we would use the dragon scale to save you,

07:35.120 --> 07:37.520
instead of repairing the Cloud Light Sword

07:37.860 --> 07:38.780
to save Bai Jiu.

07:40.390 --> 07:41.030
Yes.

07:43.370 --> 07:46.570
I hope to repair the Cloud Light Sword as soon as possible.

07:46.980 --> 07:49.310
Lord Bai Yan, you're descended from a god,

07:49.409 --> 07:50.550
yet you're also so selfish.

07:50.550 --> 07:52.030
I can understand.

07:54.360 --> 07:55.850
As a mother,

07:56.740 --> 08:00.010
she certainly doesn't want to see anything happen to her son.

08:00.010 --> 08:00.620
No.

08:01.990 --> 08:03.500
That is secondary.

08:04.410 --> 08:05.550
Then in your eyes,

08:06.470 --> 08:07.530
what is important?

08:10.140 --> 08:11.880
As the descendant of a god,

08:13.390 --> 08:15.000
between my son and the world,

08:17.080 --> 08:18.860
I must choose the world.

08:20.670 --> 08:22.950
Since you understand this,

08:23.390 --> 08:25.150
why are you doing the opposite?

08:26.050 --> 08:27.550
If Wen Xiao dies,

08:27.990 --> 08:31.160
a new Baize Goddess will appear in the mortal world.

08:31.950 --> 08:32.940
The Baize Token

08:34.289 --> 08:36.150
will choose a new master.

08:37.320 --> 08:40.320
But if Li Lun and Bai Jiu's primordial spirit combine,

08:41.309 --> 08:43.309
the two realms will be in turmoil.

08:43.669 --> 08:45.000
All beings will suffer.

08:45.990 --> 08:47.760
Many people were possessed by Li Lun before.

08:47.760 --> 08:49.160
But Bai Jiu is different.

08:49.690 --> 08:50.790
The Divine Wood clan

08:50.790 --> 08:51.990
both has vitality

08:53.090 --> 08:54.750
and the aura of death.

08:54.910 --> 08:57.240
Besides being able to revive everything,

08:57.450 --> 08:59.580
we can also absorb the world's vitality,

08:59.580 --> 09:01.200
killing all beings

09:01.520 --> 09:03.720
and making even grass be unable to grow.

09:04.410 --> 09:06.050
Without grains and fruits,

09:06.590 --> 09:08.110
without flora and dew,

09:09.970 --> 09:11.830
there will be widespread famine.

09:13.040 --> 09:14.500
Are you telling the truth?

09:16.210 --> 09:17.630
Can we still trust you?

09:19.260 --> 09:20.840
If you don't believe me,

09:22.310 --> 09:24.550
you can ask the other old Mountain Gods.

09:25.440 --> 09:26.770
You'll get your answer.

09:29.720 --> 09:31.240
It’s fate.

09:32.110 --> 09:34.040
Every generation of Baize Goddess

09:34.040 --> 09:36.330
died to save the world.

09:37.040 --> 09:39.190
Maybe fate has destined

09:41.350 --> 09:42.180
that this

09:43.470 --> 09:45.120
is your end.

09:52.680 --> 09:53.710
So,

09:56.310 --> 09:57.710
it's not the Great Demon,

09:59.760 --> 10:01.120
not Zhuo,

10:03.270 --> 10:04.720
nor Jiu.

10:08.840 --> 10:10.400
It's me.

10:28.350 --> 10:29.150
My lord.

10:29.790 --> 10:31.100
I'm useless.

10:31.550 --> 10:33.210
I didn't get the dragon scale.

10:39.700 --> 10:40.940
Don't be sad.

10:42.800 --> 10:45.120
It's Zhao Yuanzhou who was cunning.

10:49.460 --> 10:50.970
Are you afraid?

10:51.450 --> 10:52.530
No.

10:53.740 --> 10:55.860
I can die for you anytime.

11:04.320 --> 11:05.730
My question is...

11:07.570 --> 11:09.660
Are you afraid of me dying?

11:13.800 --> 11:14.510
Yes.

11:18.040 --> 11:19.900
If you die,

11:21.800 --> 11:22.980
I will die too.

11:24.310 --> 11:26.280
I'll follow you no matter what.

11:44.080 --> 11:46.070
When I was imprisoned before,

11:47.520 --> 11:49.520
I looked at the surrounding scenery

11:49.550 --> 11:51.960
day and night.

11:53.400 --> 11:55.130
I grew sick of it

11:56.390 --> 11:58.810
and wanted to go out every day.

12:01.030 --> 12:03.610
Every time I possessed someone,

12:04.270 --> 12:06.920
I lost half of my lifespan,

12:09.420 --> 12:11.140
but I couldn't help it.

12:12.070 --> 12:12.870
Just like

12:12.870 --> 12:15.850
craving sweet poison,

12:16.210 --> 12:18.000
I kept possessing others.

12:19.030 --> 12:20.630
On them,

12:20.930 --> 12:23.060
I experienced a lot of

12:24.170 --> 12:25.790
the facets of humanity,

12:26.390 --> 12:27.740
the various emotions,

12:28.870 --> 12:30.550
and natural sceneries.

12:35.460 --> 12:36.910
The mountains,

12:38.630 --> 12:39.670
the waters.

12:42.110 --> 12:43.500
But now,

12:47.590 --> 12:49.150
I still haven't found

12:49.150 --> 12:51.070
a place I can stay in.

12:53.070 --> 12:55.470
Even a stray dog

12:56.740 --> 12:59.280
can find shelter from the rain.

13:02.940 --> 13:05.410
Travelers braving the wind and snow

13:06.940 --> 13:07.860
also yearn

13:10.890 --> 13:13.010
for a lamp kept illuminated for them.

13:14.240 --> 13:15.600
But I...

13:19.890 --> 13:22.190
After everything,

13:22.590 --> 13:23.910
I have only here.

13:27.380 --> 13:29.210
I have only here.

13:33.030 --> 13:35.190
How pitiful.

13:45.160 --> 13:47.660
If I really will die,

13:49.720 --> 13:51.780
I have to find someone to die with.

13:57.080 --> 14:00.820
I have to find the grandest stage too.

14:08.360 --> 14:09.560
Let's go.

14:12.900 --> 14:19.890
♫Waiting for rocks to blossom, fools laugh at me for being stupid♫

14:19.930 --> 14:26.050
♫So many words unsaid, my voice is already hoarse♫

14:26.090 --> 14:32.940
♫Without worries, the dark night brings me home♫

14:33.020 --> 14:39.430
♫Don't fear; will the starlight remember me?♫

14:36.840 --> 14:37.880
Wait!

14:45.840 --> 14:48.780
I know you’ve done your best

14:49.360 --> 14:51.160
with the Baize Order's mission.

14:51.870 --> 14:53.520
But it’s fate.

14:55.120 --> 14:57.080
Every generation of Baize Goddess

14:57.270 --> 14:59.260
died to save the world.

14:59.990 --> 15:01.000
Perhaps

15:01.030 --> 15:02.760
fate was already predestined.

15:03.270 --> 15:04.450
I believe

15:04.710 --> 15:06.230
you will make

15:06.610 --> 15:08.160
the right choice.

15:18.840 --> 15:20.950
[Two Years Ago]

15:43.510 --> 15:44.840
It's only been a few days

15:45.260 --> 15:46.660
and you got new injuries.

15:50.620 --> 15:52.020
It's just a minor injury.

15:52.270 --> 15:53.110
I'm fine.

15:54.430 --> 15:56.300
The Gou She snake is poisonous.

15:56.800 --> 15:58.800
Why did you provoke it for no reason?

15:59.970 --> 16:00.940
I heard

16:00.940 --> 16:03.130
it has clues about Baize Token.

16:10.360 --> 16:11.690
Are you stupid?

16:13.520 --> 16:14.800
How could a minor demon

16:15.370 --> 16:17.630
know the whereabouts of the Baize Token?

16:19.880 --> 16:22.810
Even if there's only a one-millionth chance of hope,

16:23.180 --> 16:24.520
I won't give up.

16:27.000 --> 16:28.780
Your body is getting weaker.

16:29.440 --> 16:31.570
I don't want anything to happen to you.

16:35.110 --> 16:36.830
I want you to live well.

16:43.180 --> 16:44.920
You must live well.

16:46.830 --> 16:48.220
I've imagined

16:48.740 --> 16:50.680
various endings.

16:51.080 --> 16:52.760
But I didn't expect

16:53.600 --> 16:55.720
the ending was predestined.

16:55.910 --> 16:57.290
I don't want to die.

16:58.890 --> 17:00.660
I still have a lot

17:02.030 --> 17:03.090
I haven't done yet.

17:10.270 --> 17:11.530
Don't be discouraged.

17:12.790 --> 17:15.250
We can still detoxify with the dragon scale.

17:16.339 --> 17:18.270
But there is only one dragon scale.

17:22.400 --> 17:23.990
As the Baize Goddess,

17:25.750 --> 17:27.670
I have to make the right choice.

17:31.030 --> 17:32.630
Even ants fight to live.

17:34.160 --> 17:35.450
How is wanting to live

17:36.190 --> 17:38.110
not the right choice?

17:40.710 --> 17:41.830
You can

17:42.650 --> 17:44.540
ask yourself this question too.

17:47.290 --> 17:49.090
I don't want to scrape by to live,

17:50.180 --> 17:52.060
but I'm unable to die.

17:53.490 --> 17:55.090
Meanwhile, you cherish life

17:55.640 --> 17:57.130
so passionately

17:58.690 --> 18:00.350
yet must sacrifice yourself.

18:01.470 --> 18:03.400
The heavens are so unfair.

18:04.190 --> 18:06.240
So the fate of the goddess

18:06.570 --> 18:07.830
is not to save the world

18:08.960 --> 18:11.090
but to be the price of saving the world.

18:15.730 --> 18:17.090
I'm afraid of death,

18:19.280 --> 18:20.720
but even more, I can't

18:21.930 --> 18:23.090
let Bai Jiu die,

18:24.870 --> 18:26.520
or let all living beings

18:27.540 --> 18:28.890
die because of me.

18:30.710 --> 18:32.200
So the Baize Token

18:33.610 --> 18:36.620
always chooses the kindest and purest people.

18:38.300 --> 18:41.830
Only they would willingly sacrifice themselves for the world.

19:20.450 --> 19:21.090
[Zhao Yuanzhou] [Zhu Yan]

19:24.150 --> 19:27.050
[Zhao Yuanzhou] [Zhu Yan]

19:24.540 --> 19:26.220
♫A light flickers♫

19:26.290 --> 19:29.070
♫Far in the distance♫

19:29.260 --> 19:30.310
♫Scars♫

19:30.280 --> 19:31.640
Tearing up the contract

19:30.890 --> 19:33.580
♫Nourished gently by rain♫

19:33.190 --> 19:34.840
doesn't seem to be effective.

19:33.660 --> 19:35.430
♫The window opened by the wind♫

19:35.520 --> 19:36.730
♫Softly sways♫

19:36.630 --> 19:37.820
It still hurts.

19:36.780 --> 19:39.990
♫But time slips away♫

19:40.460 --> 19:42.850
♫Hastily♫

19:42.900 --> 19:47.160
♫You wear candlelight like a robe, awaiting dawn♫

19:47.480 --> 19:51.720
♫While I cradle heartache, year after year, on and on♫

19:52.100 --> 19:54.720
♫In dreams, my hometown lies under frost♫

19:52.500 --> 19:54.430
Since you tore up the contract,

19:54.780 --> 19:58.390
♫All sounds♫

19:55.470 --> 19:56.260
then,

19:58.920 --> 20:00.910
♫Are lost♫

20:00.060 --> 20:01.560
from now on,

20:01.090 --> 20:05.980
♫The wind brushes against rivers and hills♫

20:01.730 --> 20:03.630
are we still just colleagues?

20:06.040 --> 20:09.850
♫Wild blooms refuse to fall♫

20:09.930 --> 20:15.060
♫They've seen every hue the world has borne♫

20:15.090 --> 20:18.960
♫Which blossom is meant for me?♫

20:19.580 --> 20:24.100
♫As songs are sung, how many truly understand?♫

20:24.400 --> 20:27.970
♫The varied regrets we sing repeatedly♫

20:28.370 --> 20:31.130
♫Have echoed for years♫

20:31.390 --> 20:36.100
♫Hoping fate will amend♫

20:36.510 --> 20:40.500
♫Remember me, a humble♫

20:37.150 --> 20:39.200
I'll find a way.

20:39.510 --> 20:40.230
Okay.

20:41.300 --> 20:43.090
♫Blossom♫

20:41.660 --> 20:43.760
I'll find a way.

21:07.790 --> 21:09.560
We meet again, Mr. Zhuo.

21:10.310 --> 21:10.990
Why did you

21:10.990 --> 21:12.070
ask to meet me?

21:13.740 --> 21:15.230
You poisoned

21:15.900 --> 21:17.010
Wen Xiao,

21:17.910 --> 21:18.670
right?

21:19.130 --> 21:20.170
Yes.

21:25.240 --> 21:27.690
Bai Jiu put the poison on the Divine Wood.

21:27.840 --> 21:29.810
Every time Wen Xiao played it,

21:30.230 --> 21:33.140
the poison slowly entered her body.

21:34.570 --> 21:36.500
The more she used her divine power,

21:36.840 --> 21:39.050
the faster the poisoned seeped in.

21:39.610 --> 21:42.680
I also applied poison on Bai Jiu's medicine pipe.

21:43.390 --> 21:44.410
So he

21:44.840 --> 21:46.010
was poisoned too.

21:48.890 --> 21:50.960
What's your purpose?

21:50.980 --> 21:51.930
I want

21:52.390 --> 21:54.890
Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core.

21:55.790 --> 21:59.360
Exchanging the inner core of an extremely evil demon who killed you father and brother

21:59.360 --> 22:02.140
for a noble Baize Goddess's life...

22:02.600 --> 22:03.750
Why not?

22:09.650 --> 22:12.350
The Cloud Light Sword is an artifact of the Bingyi Clan.

22:12.350 --> 22:13.680
It's not ordinary iron.

22:13.690 --> 22:15.220
The fire of the mortal world

22:15.270 --> 22:16.270
can't forge it.

22:17.350 --> 22:19.280
So apart from the dragon scale,

22:20.240 --> 22:23.650
we also need to use the Ever-Burning Wood in Zhao Yuanzhou's body

22:23.650 --> 22:25.390
to smelt it.

22:27.430 --> 22:28.230
Take it.

22:31.270 --> 22:32.270
Zhao Yuanzhou.

22:33.000 --> 22:35.730
Once you use the power of the Ever-Burning Wood in your body,

22:35.730 --> 22:37.700
it will damage your inner core

22:37.730 --> 22:39.860
and greatly consume your demonic power.

22:39.860 --> 22:41.920
It'll hard to recover in a short time.

22:45.360 --> 22:46.660
Of course I know.

22:47.330 --> 22:49.590
So, before my demonic power is restored,

22:49.720 --> 22:51.310
I'll have to ask Mr. Zhuo

22:51.330 --> 22:53.050
to protect me well.

24:18.900 --> 24:20.040
Mr. Zhuo.

24:21.550 --> 24:22.530
From now on,

24:23.060 --> 24:25.430
we will protect the Wilderness

24:25.960 --> 24:27.530
and mortal world together.

24:30.300 --> 24:31.270
Promise me.

24:35.470 --> 24:37.400
Give me Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core

24:38.480 --> 24:40.210
and I'll give you the antidote.

24:47.360 --> 24:48.610
Zhao Yuanzhou!

25:08.600 --> 25:10.060
Didn't you say

25:11.640 --> 25:14.640
you're a great demon of tens of thousands of years old?

25:17.870 --> 25:19.430
An all-powerful

25:22.510 --> 25:24.790
and undying great demon?

25:28.200 --> 25:30.330
You promised not to act tough anymore.

26:21.510 --> 26:22.750
Mr. Zhuo,

26:23.540 --> 26:24.560
waiting for me?

26:27.930 --> 26:30.060
Why did you only pour yourself a drink?

26:31.240 --> 26:34.100
I've never heard of invalids who want to drink wine.

26:35.560 --> 26:37.420
The Ever-Burning Wood's torture

26:39.480 --> 26:41.810
makes the malicious energy in me flare up.

26:41.810 --> 26:43.470
I wanted to drink some Jade Ointment

26:43.470 --> 26:44.740
to relieve myself.

26:46.210 --> 26:48.220
I won't drink if you say so.

26:48.950 --> 26:50.010
I'll listen to you.

27:24.070 --> 27:26.000
We've known each other for so long.

27:26.200 --> 27:27.550
I can't believe I've never had a chance

27:27.550 --> 27:29.020
to drink with you.

27:31.130 --> 27:32.800
You almost had the chance.

27:33.360 --> 27:34.310
When?

27:36.600 --> 27:38.580
When your malicious energy went out of control

27:38.580 --> 27:41.310
and you locked yourself in the your peach blossom yard.

27:41.310 --> 27:42.590
I went to kill you.

27:43.010 --> 27:44.130
Before leaving,

27:44.160 --> 27:47.360
Ying Lei gave me two jars of pomegranate wine to see me off.

27:48.280 --> 27:50.200
Before taking action,

27:52.010 --> 27:54.240
I hoped to have a last drink

27:55.490 --> 27:57.280
and meal with you.

28:04.520 --> 28:06.010
I'd rather not have

28:06.460 --> 28:07.590
that kind of chance.

28:09.010 --> 28:10.160
This cup

28:11.000 --> 28:13.320
is a toast to how we have a blood feud

28:13.740 --> 28:15.630
but can still drink together.

28:16.650 --> 28:17.460
In the past,

28:18.920 --> 28:20.800
we did have a blood feud.

28:21.350 --> 28:22.430
In the past?

28:23.180 --> 28:23.990
Yes.

28:24.790 --> 28:25.600
In the past.

28:30.790 --> 28:32.290
In the past,

28:32.460 --> 28:34.370
I indeed hated you so much.

28:36.590 --> 28:38.490
So even if I knew

28:38.580 --> 28:40.910
you were controlled by malicious energy,

28:41.280 --> 28:43.090
I still couldn't forgive you.

28:45.860 --> 28:46.660
Later,

28:48.760 --> 28:49.980
I became a demon.

28:51.600 --> 28:53.400
I finally understand

28:54.580 --> 28:55.680
what it means

28:57.170 --> 28:58.410
by having no choice.

29:12.550 --> 29:14.040
Between us, there is

29:17.040 --> 29:18.570
both enmity and gratitude.

29:22.870 --> 29:24.310
To you, I harbor

29:26.610 --> 29:27.870
both hate and loyalty.

29:37.280 --> 29:38.810
These hundreds of emotions

29:43.090 --> 29:44.420
are ineffable.

29:49.280 --> 29:50.080
However,

29:53.030 --> 29:55.700
since I chose to be your closest friend,

30:00.000 --> 30:01.130
there's no need

30:03.140 --> 30:04.970
to talk about this anymore.

30:09.170 --> 30:10.500
Having a soulmate

30:11.910 --> 30:13.350
makes this life worth it.

30:15.990 --> 30:17.700
I hope that in the future,

30:18.330 --> 30:19.790
the world is vast

30:22.700 --> 30:24.030
and our group

30:25.470 --> 30:27.410
will walk side by side forever.

30:47.900 --> 30:48.970
The first toast

30:50.890 --> 30:53.490
is to thank you for treating me with sincerity.

30:53.640 --> 30:55.550
You helped me find the dragon bone

30:55.630 --> 30:57.100
and become a demon,

30:57.140 --> 30:58.440
saving me.

31:28.280 --> 31:31.200
♫The trees and grass of the world sway with the wind♫

31:31.260 --> 31:34.610
♫Beneath the bodhi tree, dust gathers♫

31:32.990 --> 31:34.100
The second toast

31:35.790 --> 31:36.640
is to thank you

31:36.460 --> 31:39.590
♫Who truly decides fate's design?♫

31:37.080 --> 31:38.570
for giving your all

31:39.410 --> 31:40.960
and exhausting your demonic power

31:39.670 --> 31:42.820
♫Vividly painted in black and white♫

31:42.130 --> 31:44.390
to re-forge the Cloud Light Sword for me.

31:44.660 --> 31:47.740
♫It's water under the bridge♫

31:47.820 --> 31:51.170
♫The moon sheds her light on my heart♫

31:53.140 --> 31:56.110
♫The good old days are gone for good like that lantern in my dream♫

31:56.200 --> 31:59.630
♫See immortals enter Penglai♫

32:00.720 --> 32:04.240
♫The northern wind blows from beyond the mountains♫

32:05.170 --> 32:08.210
♫Along the icy river, it drifts into my dreams♫

32:09.370 --> 32:12.410
♫Drinking wine at the Tongque Terrace♫

32:13.440 --> 32:15.880
♫Even the stars feel close enough to touch♫

32:15.960 --> 32:19.960
♫Life and death happen in an instant, but love and hate can endure for a long time♫

32:20.220 --> 32:23.600
♫Beyond cause and effect♫

32:21.270 --> 32:22.680
The third toast

32:24.420 --> 32:28.220
♫The heavens endure, the world remains eternal♫

32:25.350 --> 32:26.850
is to thank you again

32:26.880 --> 32:28.480
for your life-saving grace.

32:28.600 --> 32:32.330
♫Rock and moss♫

32:33.280 --> 32:34.360
♫Are watching♫

32:34.400 --> 32:37.370
♫A lone boat drifts through the vast world, vanishing into mist♫

32:35.000 --> 32:36.390
Life-saving grace?

32:37.450 --> 32:40.490
♫Its sound fading away♫

32:41.650 --> 32:42.500
♫I wish♫

32:42.560 --> 32:45.740
♫The sorrow of parting stayed beyond the river, and that we did not share the same mountain and moon♫

32:45.820 --> 32:49.640
♫Deep love, yet fate runs shallow♫

32:56.710 --> 32:57.630
Not my life.

32:59.850 --> 33:01.120
It's Wen Xiao's.

33:03.190 --> 33:04.330
I'm sorry.

33:05.280 --> 33:06.460
In order to save her,

33:08.250 --> 33:09.230
I still

33:10.110 --> 33:11.820
must stab you.

33:14.820 --> 33:16.740
Is this the only way?

33:38.790 --> 33:39.830
Zhao Yuanzhou!

33:49.240 --> 33:53.920
♫The flower in my palm♫

33:54.340 --> 33:59.580
♫Is everchanging♫

33:59.700 --> 34:05.020
♫Sand slips through fingertips♫

34:05.320 --> 34:10.360
♫Struggling again and again♫

34:11.170 --> 34:16.199
♫The sea of suffering has no end♫

34:14.020 --> 34:15.110
Zhao Yuanzhou!

34:16.830 --> 34:21.010
♫The spring breeze asks him♫

34:20.250 --> 34:21.760
What are you two doing?

34:21.070 --> 34:26.870
♫What troubles turned his hair white♫

34:22.130 --> 34:23.540
Don't worry.

34:23.760 --> 34:25.040
I'm fine.

34:27.139 --> 34:28.940
It's not the time to be stubborn.

34:30.580 --> 34:31.980
He's not being stubborn.

34:35.889 --> 34:37.159
Indeed,

34:38.310 --> 34:40.060
it was very dangerous just now.

34:41.400 --> 34:42.489
But luckily,

34:45.610 --> 34:47.320
Mr. Zhuo succeeded.

34:54.670 --> 34:55.940
What is this?

34:58.370 --> 34:59.530
Ever-Burning Wood.

35:05.700 --> 35:07.220
The Bingyi Sword Technique

35:07.220 --> 35:08.560
can guide and lead.

35:09.440 --> 35:11.750
Since it can remove the primordial spirit,

35:11.750 --> 35:13.630
maybe it can also remove the Ever-Burning Wood

35:13.630 --> 35:14.570
in my inner core.

35:15.530 --> 35:17.750
So we tried it together.

35:18.720 --> 35:20.920
Is this something you can try casually?

35:22.200 --> 35:23.680
Without being sure,

35:24.640 --> 35:26.590
you're risking your life.

35:29.210 --> 35:31.440
I was actually 50% sure.

35:37.050 --> 35:37.980
Thirty percent.

35:43.390 --> 35:44.790
Both of you are crazy.

35:45.800 --> 35:47.360
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

35:47.630 --> 35:48.490
What about you?

35:50.070 --> 35:50.860
I'm sorry.

35:56.030 --> 35:57.270
Don't be angry.

35:57.810 --> 35:59.270
As long as I could save you,

36:00.430 --> 36:02.180
I would've tried even if it was

36:02.550 --> 36:03.720
only 10% possible.

36:06.680 --> 36:07.710
Besides,

36:09.250 --> 36:11.180
if he really stabbed me to death,

36:11.690 --> 36:13.660
you'd get even with him.

36:14.840 --> 36:16.440
I wouldn't be shortchanged.

36:27.440 --> 36:29.400
Wen Zongyu wants my inner core

36:30.070 --> 36:32.400
only for the Ever-Burning Wood inside it.

36:32.760 --> 36:34.820
If we give him the Ever-Burning Wood,

36:35.030 --> 36:37.090
we should be able to get the antidote.

37:08.630 --> 37:09.960
The Ever-Burning Wood.

37:11.990 --> 37:12.790
Antidote.

37:18.910 --> 37:20.770
Put the Ever-Burning Wood there.

37:21.320 --> 37:22.850
I'll toss you the antidote.

37:36.000 --> 37:36.560
Retreat.

37:38.230 --> 37:39.080
More!

38:30.830 --> 38:31.950
Sir!

38:54.150 --> 38:55.410
Ever-Burning Wood...

38:58.620 --> 39:00.080
The Ever-Burning Wood...

39:00.180 --> 39:01.520
I will

39:01.850 --> 39:02.690
finally get

39:02.720 --> 39:04.050
the Ever-Burning Wood.

39:08.110 --> 39:10.240
Human beings can't touch it directly!

39:53.640 --> 39:54.880
I didn't expect

39:56.050 --> 39:58.510
his obsession toward the Ever-Burning Wood

39:58.710 --> 40:01.560
reached such a crazed extent.

40:16.850 --> 40:18.110
Where is the antidote?

40:20.360 --> 40:21.560
Give me the antidote.

40:24.840 --> 40:26.400
There is no antidote at all.

40:29.910 --> 40:31.330
The poison in Li Lun

40:32.570 --> 40:34.270
is incurable.

40:34.730 --> 40:37.660
Unless someone is willing to use their demonic power

40:37.850 --> 40:40.110
to absorb the poison into their own body.

41:15.640 --> 41:16.740
Jiu.

41:17.270 --> 41:18.060
Jiu!

41:22.790 --> 41:23.850
Ms. Pei!

41:25.710 --> 41:26.710
He is not Jiu.

41:29.680 --> 41:31.210
What are you doing here?

41:32.840 --> 41:34.500
Leaves return to their roots.

41:35.000 --> 41:36.730
Humans and demons are the same.

41:39.810 --> 41:40.640
My lord.

41:55.600 --> 41:57.070
For this last moment,

41:57.530 --> 42:00.590
I'll let you see what I really look like

42:01.610 --> 42:02.700
to see me off.

42:03.650 --> 42:04.450
No.

42:11.440 --> 42:12.800
What are you doing?

42:13.120 --> 42:14.560
Detoxifying you.

42:17.200 --> 42:18.360
I didn't expect her

42:18.990 --> 42:20.800
to be so loyal to Li Lun.

42:21.170 --> 42:21.770
No.

42:23.470 --> 42:24.800
It's not loyalty.

42:26.000 --> 42:27.790
The way she looks at Li Lun

42:28.610 --> 42:30.810
is not the way one looks at one's master.

42:33.850 --> 42:35.410
Stop!

42:36.200 --> 42:38.120
I don't need you to do this for me.

43:05.230 --> 43:06.160
Great.

43:08.720 --> 43:11.270
I finally saved you.

43:16.170 --> 43:19.040
If you hadn't saved me from the cage back then,

43:19.470 --> 43:21.240
I would have died long ago.

43:25.960 --> 43:27.130
Now,

43:29.730 --> 43:32.330
take it as me repaying you.

43:34.970 --> 43:37.040
You never owed me.

43:39.690 --> 43:41.570
Then take it as you owed me.

43:46.190 --> 43:47.990
Promise me one thing.

43:48.730 --> 43:49.670
Go ahead.

43:52.660 --> 43:54.230
I've endlessly

43:55.830 --> 43:58.130
transformed into other people.

44:01.170 --> 44:03.530
I hope you can remember

44:07.260 --> 44:08.660
the real me.

44:19.590 --> 44:20.780
Come with me.

44:22.770 --> 44:24.570
I'll take you to the Wilderness.

44:28.150 --> 44:29.830
Are you afraid?

44:30.270 --> 44:31.380
No.

44:32.590 --> 44:34.700
I can die for you anytime.

44:35.050 --> 44:36.760
If you die,

44:37.490 --> 44:38.820
I will die too.

44:40.420 --> 44:42.430
I'll follow you in life and death.

44:47.140 --> 44:51.980
♫The wind brushes against rivers and hills♫

44:52.030 --> 44:55.850
♫Wild blooms refuse to fall♫

44:55.910 --> 45:01.020
♫They've seen every hue the world has borne♫

45:01.120 --> 45:05.100
♫Which blossom is meant for me?♫

45:05.560 --> 45:10.110
♫As songs are sung, how many truly understand?♫

45:10.200 --> 45:13.990
♫The varied regrets we sing repeatedly♫

45:14.360 --> 45:17.150
♫Have echoed for years♫

45:17.430 --> 45:22.130
♫Hoping fate will amend♫

45:22.570 --> 45:26.510
♫Remember me, a humble♫

45:27.350 --> 45:28.810
♫Blossom♫
